# llama.cpp build pin (PLAN.md §4.1, TODO 0.1)
#
# scripts/fetch_llama_server.sh reads this file. Upstream publishes no checksum
# manifest for these release assets, so SHA256 below is trust-on-first-use: it was
# computed from the archive at this tag and is re-verified on every later fetch.
#
# To move to a newer llama.cpp: change LLAMA_TAG, re-download, replace the digest
# with the value the script prints, and re-run scripts/bench_llm.py — the memory
# numbers in PLAN.md §2.1 are build-specific.

